      "path": "dsh.cordis.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-image-settings bundle patch layer: the single plugin row that mounts\n# the dsh-image-settings plugin.\n#\n# The row is the BARE package name: dsh resolves it to `main`\n# (dist/dsh/index.js — the dsh plugin entry, the thin host half: the\n# `image-settings:` settings section) as its node half, and the web app's\n# client scanner keys the same row's name to\n# `require.resolve('dsh-image-settings/package.json')` to pick up the\n# browser half (`dsh.client` + the `./client` export). Dual-face package,\n# one row.\n#\n# No config row: the bundle boots with the schema defaults (enabled on,\n# auto-unrolled, row-width images) — the user's `image-settings:` section\n# in settings.yaml (or an out-of-band edit of it) tunes it at boot or\n# hot-reload, no row change needed.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-image-settings\n      name: 'dsh-image-settings'\n"
    }
